1
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:18,020
Welcome to Miqat Al-Khaleej. Monitor active contracts, fleet and captain readiness, and quarter revenues live from the Executive Dashboard with bilingual and dark-mode support.

2
00:00:18,317 --> 00:00:33,277
In Fleet, monitor buses, registrations, and insurance; in Technical Inspections, 16 daily safety checkpoints link to contracts with WhatsApp PDF dispatch.

3
00:00:33,567 --> 00:00:49,567
Manage transport and VIP charter contracts with route details, passenger manifests, official PDFs, and public QR verification.

4
00:00:49,884 --> 00:01:05,404
Track drivers and accounts in Captains, while drivers use an isolated Captain Portal to submit daily inspections and view trips, custody, and earnings.

5
00:01:05,701 --> 00:01:21,781
In People Management, store customer profiles and VAT IDs, manage staff custody and advances, and track representatives and trip commissions.

6
00:01:22,084 --> 00:01:41,044
Invoices show live Paid, Partial, or Unpaid status; inside invoice details, track collection progress to the halala and record bank or cash payments directly.

7
00:01:41,334 --> 00:01:57,254
Create tax invoices in four organized steps: link a contract to auto-fill client data, enter price, and watch 15% VAT and the side summary calculate live.

8
00:01:57,551 --> 00:02:15,071
In Purchases, link expenses to vehicles with Before or Includes-VAT pricing; in Accounting and Chart of Accounts, track net profit, liquidity, and per-bus margins.

9
00:02:15,368 --> 00:02:34,168
ZATCA VAT Return Boxes 1–16 stay copy-ready; in the Unified Financial Exports Center, filter across 19 criteria, preview 9 financial statements, and export PDF, Excel, or JSON in one click.

10
00:02:34,485 --> 00:02:52,325
Complete with company and bank settings, direct ZATCA integration, automated WhatsApp notifications, and granular administrator permissions across every module.
